AI Knowledge and Domain Knowledge
  The things that are valuable for your business and the ability of AI do overlap, but it is     our job to find and utilize this overlap. 

  AI experts know what AI can and cannot do 
  Domain experts know what your business needs to do and the value it brings. (Sales,            marketing, etc)

  Project managers should bring together both people who are knowldgeable in AI and people      who are experts in the business area to align tasks based the need and feasibility. 
  They can work together to find a project at the intersection of both What AI can do and       what is Valuable for your business
    These are called cross-functional teams

Brainstorming Framework
  1. Think about automating tasks rather than automating jobs 
      Ex. Call Center routing, radiologists
      Instead of automating a call center employee's whole job, it is easier and more               feasible to automate a specific task like call and email routing. 
      Radiologists do many tasks but AI can automate x-ray reading using AI assistance
  2. What are the main drivers of business value?
  3. What are the main pain points in your business?

  You can make progress even without big data
    Have more data almost never hurts
    Data makes some businesses (like web search) defensible
      But with small datasets, you can still  make progress
